other competing messages,

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:34.901
and that's where the
platforms came in,

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:37.037
and they literally
stopped free speech,

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:39.439 align:start size:97% position:3%
