00:21:48.373 --> 00:21:49.841
Ya know, one thing I'll say

00:21:49.841 --> 00:21:53.045 align:start size:84% position:16%
is that when I look
back at what happened,

00:21:53.045 --> 00:21:55.714 align:start size:94% position:6%
the one thing I wish I
