00:22:47.632 --> 00:22:49.267
"I shouldn't have done"...

00:22:49.267 --> 00:22:50.502
I don't think that's healthy.

00:22:50.502 --> 00:22:52.104 align:start size:88% position:13%
- What do you think kept
you going like that?

00:22:52.104 --> 00:22:53.238
You're not broken now.

00:22:53.238 --> 00:22:54.740
You're so thriving.

00:22:54.740 --> 00:22:56.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
Every time I'm around you,
