00:23:00.045 --> 00:23:02.114
You just freaking love life.

00:23:02.114 --> 00:23:04.683 align:start position:0%
Did you ever get to a point
where you were starting to break

00:23:04.683 --> 00:23:05.650
or anything like that?

00:23:05.650 --> 00:23:07.152
- Yeah, yeah, of course I did.

00:23:07.152 --> 00:23:10.722
I think that the worst part
was before I went to jail.

00:23:10.722 --> 00:23:12.457 align:start size:84% position:16%
It's like you're
dying in slow motion.

00:23:12.457 --> 00:23:13.759 align:start size:84% position:16%
And that's where
you know, you can't-

00:23:13.759 --> 00:23:14.993
- 'Cause you know you're going.

00:23:14.993 --> 00:23:15.994 align:start size:81% position:19%
- And you can't
restart your life.

00:23:17.496 --> 00:23:19.231
I lived in the big house
